spec RearRouteHandover.tla
check INVARIANTS NoRearContamination NoStaleAcknowledgement
reach LateInFlight | control
reach SameModeRevision | control
reach StaleRequest | control
reach StaleAck | control
reach LinkRevoked | control
reach Rearmed | control
run control capacity=1 | Capacity=1 MaxRevision=3 MaxLink=2 InitialMode="control"
run native capacity=2 | Capacity=2 MaxRevision=2 MaxLink=2 InitialMode="native"
